## 3. Key Terms

| English Term | 中文解释 | Exam-style meaning |
|---|---|---|
| Constructor | 构造方法 / 构造器 | A special method-like block that runs when an object is created |
| Default constructor | 默认构造器 | A constructor with no parameters |
